{"html": "<section class=\"ec-product-scenarios ec-library-detail-section\" id=\"product-use-scenarios\" data-scene-ver=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"product-scenario-title\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">用途与选型</p><h2 id=\"product-scenario-title\">适用场景建议</h2><p class=\"ec-scenario-role\">14 oz 塑料带柄杯型</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-grid\"><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/backyard-bbq-cups/\">后院烧烤 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>14 oz 塑料带柄杯身，手柄与杯体一次成型。杯壁厚，放在烫过的石台面上不软，一轮一轮续得下去。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/open-air-nightclub/\">户外酒吧 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>扎啤按杯卖，手柄让客人端着走动也不洒。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/camping-drinkware/\">露营与户外 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>手柄能挂在背包扣上，走一段路也不占手。</p></article></div><div class=\"ec-scenario-check\"><h3>项目确认</h3><p>核对长桌摆位、多人轮次与清洗条件；出杯速度、叠放收纳与夜间照明条件；收纳体积、背包空间与煮沸饮品的使用温度。</p></div><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">以上为选型建议。请按实际用途审核所选配置与样品。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=BSB-011\">讨论 BSB-011 的应用方案 →</a></section>", "kind": "product"}